    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned two-bedroom second-floor apartment in Centre House Apartment Complex, ideally located within easy reach of Carlow town centre. Offering comfortable accommodation, secure gated parking and excellent accessibility to local amenities, this property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a convenient town-centre base.\n\nCentre House is a well-maintained apartment complex serviced by both lift and stair access, with the added benefit of gated private car parking. The apartment itself extends from a welcoming entrance hall into a bright open-plan kitchen/dining/living room, providing a versatile and sociable living space. Two doors open onto a small balconette, offering an attractive additional outdoor area.\n\nThere are two generous double bedrooms, both featuring fitted wardrobes, with the principal bedroom further benefiting from a private ensuite. A main bathroom completes the accommodation. \n\nOutside \nGated car parking\nBalconette"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (11.75ft x 9.38ft) with carpet fitted. Airing cupboard. Alarm keypad. <br>Kitchen/Dining/Living Area (22.57ft x 13.59ft) Open plan area with fitted low and eye level units, electric hob & oven. Tiling to floor in kitchen area and around work counters. Carpet to living area. Two door access to balconette. Intercom to main door (ground door).<br>Bedroom 1 (15.52ft x 8.86ft) with two-door fitted wardrobe. Carpet fitted. <br>Bedroom 2 (13.42ft x 9.19ft) with three-door fitted wardrobe. Carpet fitted. Ensuite. <br>En-suite (5.58ft x 5.18ft) Fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. & shower.<br>Bathroom (6.99ft x 5.87ft) Fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b. & bath. "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mains Services\nElectric Heating\nMains - Electricity\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER C1\nBER No. 118629971\n Energy Performance Indicator: 151.47 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "One of the property's key attractions is its superb location. Situated close to the heart of Carlow town, residents can enjoy an extensive selection of shops, cafes, restaurants, services and recreational facilities within easy reach. Carlow Train Station is also conveniently accessible, making the property particularly attractive to commuters.\n\n <small>Disclaimer: These particulars do not constitute nor constitute any part of an offer or a contract. They are issued on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through this office. All statements contained in these particulars as to this property are made without responsibility on the part of the Agents or the Vendor/Lessor. None of the statements contained in these particulars as to this property are to be relied on as statements or representations of fact. The particulars, various plans, photographs, descriptions and measurements (taken at longest room points) have been carefully prepared, but their accuracy is not guaranteed and any intending Purchasers/Lessees shall satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to their correctness. Map is for identification purposes only. No omission, accidental error or misconception shall be ground for a claim for compensation nor for the recession of the Contract by either the Vendor/Lessor or the Purchaser/Lessee.</small> \n"
      },
